[{"id":"CN-TR-FAQ-002","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","三次握手","排障"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":16,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>三次握手成功后为什么仍可能访问失败？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>握手只证明 TCP 连接建立；TLS 证书校验、HTTP 状态码、代理、认证、应用处理或响应读取仍可能失败。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>将时间线拆成 DNS → TCP → TLS → HTTP → 应用，不能把所有后续失败都叫作“网络不通”。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>握手报文至少要和状态一起读：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>报文\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>关键确认\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>典型状态\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SYN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>客户端提出 ISN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>SYN-SENT\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SYN-ACK\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>服务端确认并提出 ISN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>SYN-RECEIVED\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>ACK\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>客户端确认服务端 ISN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>ESTABLISHED\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>握手超时、RST 和握手成功后的 TLS/HTTP 失败是不同证据，不能用一个“端口不通”概括。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"app-testing-clear-data-vs-uninstall","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["功能","安装"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(六)功能与场景测试.md","articleTitle":"App测试(六)功能与场景测试","articlePath":"posts/a3a4aca2/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(六)功能与场景测试.md","articleTitle":"App测试(六)功能与场景测试","articlePath":"posts/a3a4aca2/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>清除数据和卸载重装为什么不能互相替代？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>清除数据保留安装包，卸载重装同时改变安装状态和通常的数据状态，观察到的首次启动与升级行为不同。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>清除数据适合重复同一版本的空数据实验；卸载重装还会覆盖包不存在、安装权限、默认配置和首次引导。升级验证则应保留旧版本数据，不能用清除数据制造一个并不存在的迁移场景。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-08-keyset-pagination-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["Keyset Pagination","深分页","稳定排序"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(八)执行计划与查询优化.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(八)执行计划与查询优化","articlePath":"posts/3bb0fc53/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(八)执行计划与查询优化.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(八)执行计划与查询优化","articlePath":"posts/3bb0fc53/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>订单按 \u003ccode>ordered_at DESC, id DESC\u003c/code> 分页，如何避免大 OFFSET，并保证下一页不漏行？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> id, ordered_at, total_amount\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> orders\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> user_id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> ?\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> (ordered_at, id) \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&lt;\u003c/span> (?, ?)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> ordered_at \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">DESC\u003c/span>, id \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">DESC\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">LIMIT \u003cspan class=\"number\">20\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Keyset 分页把“上一页最后一行”变成下一页的边界：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">排序：ordered_at DESC, id DESC\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">上一页末尾：(2026-07-01 10:00:00, 120)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">下一页条件： (ordered_at, id) &lt; (&#x27;2026-07-01 10:00:00&#x27;, 120)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>id\u003c/code> 是时间相同的 tie-breaker，比较方向必须与排序方向一致，才能避免重复或漏行。它适合连续向后翻页，但不能直接跳到任意页码；排序列可为 \u003ccode>NULL\u003c/code> 时还要先规定 NULL 的位置。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-05-not-in-null-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["NOT IN","NULL","三值逻辑"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询","articlePath":"posts/55ce38b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(五)多表查询与子查询","articlePath":"posts/55ce38b/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么 \u003ccode>WHERE id NOT IN (SELECT user_id FROM orders)\u003c/code> 可能返回空集？如何改写？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> u.id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> users \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> u\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">NOT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">EXISTS\u003c/span> (\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> orders \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> o \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> o.user_id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> u.id)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> u.id;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>NOT IN\u003c/code> 遇到候选集合中的 \u003ccode>NULL\u003c/code> 会产生 \u003ccode>UNKNOWN\u003c/code>，而 \u003ccode>WHERE\u003c/code> 只保留 \u003ccode>TRUE\u003c/code>：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>\u003ccode>id\u003c/code>\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>候选集合含 \u003ccode>NULL\u003c/code> 时的判断\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>3\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>3 NOT IN (1, NULL)\u003c/code> → \u003ccode>UNKNOWN\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>1 NOT IN (1, NULL)\u003c/code> → \u003ccode>FALSE\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>所以结果可能为空，即使没有任何用户真的下过订单。\u003ccode>NOT EXISTS\u003c/code> 把判断改成逐行存在性，不受集合中的空值污染；若继续使用 \u003ccode>NOT IN\u003c/code>，必须先保证子查询列 \u003ccode>NOT NULL\u003c/code>，并用含 \u003ccode>NULL\u003c/code> 的 seed 验证边界。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-04-monthly-sales-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["GROUP BY","月度销售","日期"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(四)查询基础与聚合.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(四)查询基础与聚合","articlePath":"posts/80283a7e/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(四)查询基础与聚合.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(四)查询基础与聚合","articlePath":"posts/80283a7e/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>按月统计 paid 订单销售额，要求月份升序且没有订单的月份不凭空补行，SQL 怎么写？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> DATE_FORMAT(ordered_at, \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%Y-%m&#x27;\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">month\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">SUM\u003c/span>(total_amount) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> sales\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> orders\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> status \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;paid&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">GROUP\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> DATE_FORMAT(ordered_at, \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%Y-%m&#x27;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">month\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>这条查询只对实际出现的 \u003ccode>paid\u003c/code> 月份分组。以示例 seed 为例，聚合输入只有一组：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>month\u003c/th>\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\">paid rows\u003c/th>\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\">sales\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>2026-07\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">\u003ccode>1000.00\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>没有订单的月份不会凭空出现；如果产品要求补零，需要先生成日历月份，再对聚合结果 \u003ccode>LEFT JOIN\u003c/code>。对 \u003ccode>DATETIME\u003c/code> 过滤时使用 \u003ccode>[start, end)\u003c/code> 半开区间，避免把月末 \u003ccode>23:59:59.999999\u003c/code> 漏掉。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-quality-test-isolation","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","测试","隔离","fixture"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(九)类型与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"Python(九)类型与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/62348dbe/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(九)类型与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"Python(九)类型与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/62348dbe/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么测试必须彼此隔离？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>测试顺序、全局状态、真实时间和网络会制造偶发失败，使结果不能可靠定位代码行为。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>隔离的目标是让一次失败只由当前测试的输入和依赖解释。可以把外部状态放进测试作用域：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">test_parse\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">tmp_path, monkeypatch\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    source = tmp_path / \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;input.txt&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    source.write_text(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;ok&quot;\u003c/span>, encoding=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;utf-8&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    monkeypatch.setenv(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;MODE&quot;\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;test&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">assert\u003c/span> parse_file(source) == \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;ok&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>测试自行建立输入、清理临时资源，并用可控替身替换时间、网络或环境变量，就能减少顺序依赖和偶发污染。隔离不是拒绝所有集成测试，而是明确哪些状态由本测试拥有、哪些协作由专门场景验证。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]